# EventForce Management System

## Salesforce Implementation

A Salesforce-based **Customer Relationship Management (CRM) solution** designed to digitize and coordinate event management operations. EventForce centralizes client bookings, venue reservations, vendor coordination, event scheduling, feedback collection, automation, reporting, and controlled access in a single Salesforce environment.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

The **EventForce Management System** is developed as an Event Planner CRM solution using Salesforce. It replaces fragmented manual activities with centralized records, automated workflows, approval processes, real-time visibility, and analytics.

The implementation uses:

- Salesforce Custom Objects
- Lookup and Master-Detail Relationships
- Many-to-Many Relationships
- Validation Rules
- Formula Fields
- Salesforce Flows
- Approval Processes
- Email Alerts
- Apex Classes and Triggers
- Batchable and Schedulable Apex
- Lightning App
- Reports and Dashboards
- Profiles, Roles, Permission Sets
- Organization-Wide Defaults and Sharing Rules

---

## 🎯 Objectives

- Centralize event, client, vendor, venue, and feedback information.
- Automate event scheduling and client reminder workflows.
- Automate event cancellation approval and notifications.
- Improve data accuracy using validation rules, formula fields, lookup filters, and controlled relationships.
- Prevent venue double-booking for the same date.
- Provide role-based access and controlled record visibility.
- Provide reports and dashboards for upcoming events, budgets, vendor activity, and operational insights.
- Reduce manual processes and improve booking efficiency.

